<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Checkpoint Systems cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Checkpoint Systems cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Three brokerages downgraded Checkpoint Systems Inc.</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown cut its rating to buy from strong buy, Lehman Brothers cut to neutral from outperform, and Raymond James cut to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Lehman said it was suspending its price target &quot;until we get some clarity on Checkpoint's status.&quot;</p>
<p>-- On Thursday Checkpoint said it had terminated its merger plans with Ultrak Inc.</p>
</text>
